  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Support to the EBRD Crisis Response Special</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Grant will be crucial to cover critically needed investments in essential water infrastructure damaged as a result of the on-going war, while ensuring the introduction of energy efficient technologies and supporting efficient usage of water and electricity. The EBRD loan complemented by the Grant will support restoration of drinking water supply including modernisation of the damaged water intake and supply infrastructure in the City in line with the national standards. The urgent investments in basic infrastructure become more critical in the context of recent damages to Khahovka HPP and IDPs, the number of which is growing in the City as a result of the war.</narrative>
  </description>
